---
title: Task Breakdown Logic
---
flowchart TD
    Input[Parent Task] --> CheckKeywords{Check Task<br/>Summary}
    
    CheckKeywords -->|Contains 'API'<br/>or 'Backend'| APITasks[Backend Subtasks:<br/>- Setup API endpoint<br/>- Business logic<br/>- Validation<br/>- Unit tests]
    
    CheckKeywords -->|Contains 'UI'<br/>or 'Frontend'| UITasks[Frontend Subtasks:<br/>- Component structure<br/>- UI layout<br/>- User interactions<br/>- Component tests]
    
    CheckKeywords -->|Contains 'Bug'<br/>or 'Fix'| BugTasks[Bug Fix Subtasks:<br/>- Reproduce issue<br/>- Implement fix<br/>- Regression test<br/>- Verify scenarios]
    
    CheckKeywords -->|Generic| GenericTasks[Generic Subtasks:<br/>- Analysis & design<br/>- Implementation<br/>- Testing<br/>- Documentation]
    
    APITasks --> AssignComplexity[Assign Complexity<br/>low/medium/high]
    UITasks --> AssignComplexity
    BugTasks --> AssignComplexity
    GenericTasks --> AssignComplexity
    
    AssignComplexity --> Output[Subtasks with<br/>Complexity Levels]

    style Input fill:#e3f2fd
    style APITasks fill:#fff3e0
    style UITasks fill:#e8f5e9
    style BugTasks fill:#ffebee
    style GenericTasks fill:#f3e5f5
    style Output fill:#e1f5e1
